{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10117160","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10117160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1011716001:1":{"text":"エルロン、ライカたちは異種族と結託し、流光の樹の下で聖なる祈りの儀式を妨害した。","source_cn":"埃隆、莱卡等人联合外族，公然在流荧树下破坏神圣的祝祈仪式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27CFA6B79F453E9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1011716002:1":{"text":"茨の護衛隊よ、早く奴らを捕まえないか！","source_cn":"荆棘卫士，还不拦下他们？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF29953AA233F767","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1011716003:1":{"text":"はっ……","source_cn":"是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C8A332F701EE151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1011716004:1":{"text":"皆さん、私はヴィジランツの隊長です。私たちは北の村で、村から逃げ出した人が残した日記を見つけました。","source_cn":"各位，我是薄暮巡游队的队长。这是我们从北方村子里取回的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x479EEA297545A8B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1011716005:1":{"text":"彼の村は腐敗に呑み込まれ、死の土地と化していました！どうかこの日記を……血と涙で書かれた言葉を聞いてください！","source_cn":"他所在的村子已经被腐化吞没，毫无生机！请看看这篇日记，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA1AB878494033A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1011716006:0":{"text":"イミル様はもう来てくれないのか？茨の護衛隊はどこだ？もう行かなくては、ああ、我が故郷よ……！","source_cn":"伊米尔贤者为什么不再来了？荆棘卫队又在哪里？我要走了，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D352143AD606FD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1011716007:1":{"text":"皆さんが茨の護衛隊に入った時、その身を茨にして、森を守ると誓いを立てたはずです。","source_cn":"我知道大家加入荆棘卫队时，立下的誓言是化身荆棘，守护丛林。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DE1ABDF203542A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1011716008:0":{"text":"ならなぜ、我らの愛する同族の故郷が腐敗に奪われたとき、イミル様は何もせず、人々を路頭に迷わせたのです！？","source_cn":"那为什么，当我们亲爱的同族被腐化夺去家园时，伊米尔却袖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3740B99CD68E5AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1011716008":{"text":"ならなぜ、我らの愛する同族の故郷が腐敗に奪われたとき、イミル様は何もせず、人々を路頭に迷わせたのです！？","source_cn":"那为什么，当我们亲爱的同族被腐化夺去家园时，伊米尔却袖手旁观，任由大家流离失所呢？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3740B99CD68E5AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1011716009:1":{"text":"……ヴィジランツと異郷者の話なんて、信用できるか！","source_cn":"……薄暮和外乡人，你们的话不可信！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3851C95A08FFE6E5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"……ヴィジランツと異郷者の話なんて、信用できるか！","female":"……ヴィジランツと異郷者の話なんて、信用できるか！","variant_male_record_index":"107967","variant_female_record_index":"107968","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1011716010:1":{"text":"賢者様が我らの聖樹を腐敗させるはずがない！","source_cn":"贤者有什么理由腐化我们的圣树？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C9958E098F56B49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1011716011:1":{"text":"先祖代々、私たちは皆、ミサタ様より賜った流光の樹を見上げながら育ってきました。","source_cn":"弥萨忒将流荧树赐予我们，多少代孩子，都仰望着它渐渐成长。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86EE0C97D6A6E474","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1011716012:1":{"text":"聖樹は永遠です。でも、森中に張り巡らされた腐敗の魔法陣を使えば、イミル様は流光の樹をまるごと腐敗させ、森の生命力を手中に収めることができるのです！","source_cn":"圣树是不朽的，但是通过遍布整片丛林的腐化法阵，伊米尔可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB58C0A03DD0250B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1011716013:1":{"text":"イミル様……いいえ、イミルは権力と地位、そして自分を慕うあなたたちよりも、老いを恐れた。","source_cn":"伊米尔……他已经有了权力和地位，有了信任着他的你们，但...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9A3E6FBD507704C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1011716014:1":{"text":"そしてこの世に存在する、権力と名声をなげうつ価値がある唯一のもの……","source_cn":"世界上，只有一件事能让人甘愿放弃权力和名望……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D8DAB28AF4ACFAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1011716015:1":{"text":"それは……<style=\"highlight\">永遠の命</style>！","source_cn":"那就是……<style=highlight>永生</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x729415D0DBBB488D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1011716016:1":{"text":"永遠の命……！？","source_cn":"永生……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68FDA709E7979E0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1011716017:1":{"text":"茨の皆さん、その目を見開いて我らの聖樹を見てください！","source_cn":"荆棘，睁开双眼，看看我们的流荧圣树！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96DBEE644D93F575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1011716018:1":{"text":"逞しい木の根、木陰の下を流れる泉、満天の星の如く輝く木の葉……それが今はこの有様だ！","source_cn":"它的根系，荫蔽下的清泉，曾经闪烁如繁星一般的叶片，现在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CB2A58C0347905B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1011716019:1":{"text":"流光の樹を腐敗させたのは私たちではなく、あなた方が信頼していた賢者イミル……いえ、私はもう彼を賢者とは呼びません。彼は賢者などではなく、森の罪人です！","source_cn":"腐化流荧树的不是我们，而是你们一直信赖的伊米尔——我不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30C813D549B82032","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1011716020:1":{"text":"る、流光の子……","source_cn":"流、流荧树之子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x217E359D8A7A134E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1011716021:1":{"text":"ええ、私は流光の子です。","source_cn":"是。我是流荧树之子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24997C21FA4E17A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1011716022:0":{"text":"そして今、私はハッキリと流光の樹の声が聞こえました。","source_cn":"而今，我要告知诸位，我清楚地听到了流荧树的声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C0B3935428BCE23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1011716023:1":{"text":"それは、腐敗に侵され、我々の盲目と軽率に心を痛めながらも、ミサタ様に我らの赦しを請う祈りの声です！","source_cn":"——那是被腐化侵染，为我们的盲目和轻信悲痛，却还在恳求...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54AEB2D8D00EF04C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1011716024:1":{"text":"ミサタ様……！ほ、本当に流光の樹の声が聞こえたのか！？","source_cn":"弥萨忒有灵……！你真的听到流荧树的声音了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBB639D8FB0BAED4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1011716025:1":{"text":"イミル様、私たちは……彼の言うことは、本当なのですか？","source_cn":"伊米尔贤者，我们……他们说的，是真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F75593475DDEB86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1011716026:1":{"text":"くだらん。流光の子などそもそも存在しない！茨の名において、奴らを捕らえるのだ！","source_cn":"胡扯，根本没有什么流荧树之子！以荆棘的名义，我命令你们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C5C561CB0DF6238","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1011716027:1":{"text":"で、ですが……","source_cn":"但、但是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFCD395CFAE1BF7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1011716028:1":{"text":"ミサタ様は、我々に善悪を見極める目と、森の声を聞く耳をお与えくださった。","source_cn":"弥萨忒赐予了我们明辨是非的双目，又使我们的双耳可以倾听...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x006156167E37CFAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1011716029:1":{"text":"森の子らよ、お願いです。どうかその目を曇らせないで、森の声に耳を傾けてください。","source_cn":"丛林的子民，我恳求你们，澄清视界，倾听衷言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24D9076C73AF7BEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1011716030:1":{"text":"そして、あなたたちの武器を、ユグドラシルの真の敵――イミルに突きつけるのです！","source_cn":"然后，将你们的武器对准薄